title: Bebe
position: -17,193
---
<<declare $talkedToBebe = false>>
<<declare $egg = false>>
<<if !$talkedToBebe>>
    Bebe: Have you seen my rabbit?
    -> Yes
        Bebe: Are you playing with me?
        //Bebe walks away
    -> No
        Bebe: Hm.
        Bebe: Can you find me if you'd see my rabbit?
        -> Okay
            Bebe: Thanks.
            Bebe: My rabbit listens better than most people here.
        -> Maybe
            Bebe: Figures.
            Bebe: Last night had a lot of maybes.
        -> No
            Bebe: Right.
            Bebe: Pretty honest.
            Bebe: That was rare last night.
        -> Look closer
            Bebe: ...I am.
            Bebe: You see more when you stop staring.
    <<set $talkedToBebe = true>>
<<elseif !$egg>>
    //Variation 1 - Available after the collectible is unlocked
    Bebe: Everything was fine...
    Bebe: Then Ghosty brought out the veggies.
    Bebe: After that, people shifted from editing themselves.
<<else>>
    Bebe: Strange, isn't it?
    Bebe: People think they hide things...
    Bebe: but they mostly hide from themselves.
<<endif>>
===

title: Magician
position: 95,3
---
<<declare $talkedToMagician = false>>
<<declare $hat = false>>
<<if !$talkedToMagician>>
    Magician: Urgh... my head.
    Magician: Last night was... a lot.
    -> Yeah, it was something. Have you seen my keys?
        Magician: Keys?
        Magician: What do you mean keys?
        -> You know keys... to open doors?
            Magician: Hmm.
            Magician: I'm not sure.
            Magician: Doors are overrated anyway.
            Magician: But...
            Magician: Do you want to play a game?
            -> Yes
                Magician: Go on, look under the bed. I left a surprise for you.
                Magician: I guess I tend to hide things...
                Magician: when I don't know what to do with them.
                <<set $talkedToMagician = true>>
                <<interact Magician>>
            //Bed is triggered to claim magician hat
            -> No
                Magician: Okay. Suit yourself.
            //Magician walks away
<<elseif !$hat>>
    Magician: I invited Dolores last night.
    Magician: Thought it might help something settle...
    Magician: Guess I just moved things around instead.
<<else>>
    Magician: Funny thing about parties...
    Magician: People show up for one reason and leave because of another.
<<endif>>
