title: Ghosty
position: -240,3
---
<<declare $talkedToGhosty = false>>
<<declare $shroom = false>>
<<if !$talkedToGhosty>>
    Ghosty: Ohhh... I feel so alive today.
    Ghosty: Mornings after parties always feel brighter.
    -> I need to go home. Have you seen my keys?
        Ghosty: Do I look like a lost-and-found?
        Ghosty: Happens every time I host.
    -> You look good. What's your secret?
        Ghosty: I eat a lot of veggies. 
        Ghosty: Like A LOT.
        -> Sounds trippy.
        Ghosty: You should try it sometime.
        <<set $talkedToGhosty = true>>
        //Mushroom chair is triggered to claim mushroom
<<elseif !$shroom>>
    Ghosty: I love hosting.
    Ghosty: People relax... forget their lines.
    Ghosty: Not my fault if the truth shows up early.
<<else>>
    Ghosty: People think parties are about music.
    Ghosty: I think they're about permission.
<<endif>>
