title: Dolores
position: 146,-221
---
<<declare $talkedToDolores = false>>
<<declare $heart = false>>
<<if !$talkedToDolores>>
    Dolores: ...
    -> Wow, Dolores. You survived last night!
    Dolores: You say. 
    Dolores: I still feel like I'm in the wrong version of the morning.
    Dolores: Do I look like a bird to you...?
    -> Uhh, I don't know.
    Dolores: Anyways, always same ... 
    Dolores: All that aside, why do you always call me when you're high?
        -> I didn't call you. You were here when I arrived yesterday.
        Dolores: Are you high? Do you even listen to what I'm saying?
        Dolores: Because I remember being called.
        -> Can you just tell me where my keys are?
        Dolores: Don't worry, I'll help you find your keys. Come here. 
        //Dolores goes back a little if possible and continue after the player follows
        Dolores: Let's talk over here. 
        Dolores: I don't trust Bebe. Who'd bring their rabbit to a private house party? Freaky.
        Dolores: Okay, take a deep breath now. 
        Dolores: When was the last time you saw your keys?
        -> Take a deep breath
            -> *Sigh...*
            Dolores: Good. Stay with that feeling.
        -> I saw it in the Magician's hat last time
            Dolores: He does like hiding things in plain sight. 
        Dolores: Sometimes what you're looking for isn't lost.
        Dolores: Just listen to your heart. 
        Dolores: I'm sure you'll find what you're looking for.
        <<set $talkedToDolores = true>>
        //Heart poster is triggered to claim heart
<<elseif !$heart>>
    Dolores: Have you seen Bebe?
    Dolores: ...I miss her, actually.
    Dolores: Didn't know what I'd say if I found her.
    Dolores: Still don't.
<<else>>
    <<once>>
        Dolores: ...
        Dolores: It's odd.
        Dolores: You can feel closer to someone than you've ever been...
        Dolores: and still not know where to stand.
    <<else>>
        Dolores: He watches Bebe when he thinks no one notices.
        Dolores: ...
    <<endonce>>
<<endif>>
